{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "bar-chart",
  "title": "Bar chart",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Vertical bars that compare one value across a few categories or periods (weekdays, districts, service types). Bars start at zero, the answer is highlighted, the rest recede.",
    "id": "Batang vertikal yang membandingkan satu nilai di beberapa kategori atau periode (hari, kecamatan, jenis layanan). Batang dimulai dari nol, jawabannya disorot, sisanya memudar."
  },
  "titleId": "Bar chart",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Highlight the answer",
        "desc": "The busiest day in the series color, the rest muted. Hover any bar for its value; the others dim. With `data-lds-grow` the bars rise from the baseline on first view.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Which days are busiest?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Citizen reports received per weekday, this week</div></div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Citizen reports per weekday. Friday is busiest with 31 reports.\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 38%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Mon</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 56%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Tue</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 81%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">26 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Wed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 69%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">22 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Thu</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 97%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">31 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Fri</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 28%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sat</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 13%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">4 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sun</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Changing the period",
        "desc": "Switch weeks: bars change height over 480 ms on the in-out curve, from wherever they are.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Which days are busiest?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Citizen reports received per weekday</div></div>\n    <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Period\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 200px;\">\n      <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('.bars__bar').forEach(b => { b.style.height = b.dataset.a; b.firstChild.textContent = b.dataset.ta; })\">This week</button>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('.bars__bar').forEach(b => { b.style.height = b.dataset.b; b.firstChild.textContent = b.dataset.tb; })\">Last week</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Submissions per weekday for the selected week\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 38%;\" data-a=\"38%\" data-ta=\"12 reports\" data-b=\"47%\" data-tb=\"15 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Mon</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 56%;\" data-a=\"56%\" data-ta=\"18 reports\" data-b=\"66%\" data-tb=\"21 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Tue</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 81%;\" data-a=\"81%\" data-ta=\"26 reports\" data-b=\"59%\" data-tb=\"19 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">26 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Wed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 69%;\" data-a=\"69%\" data-ta=\"22 reports\" data-b=\"75%\" data-tb=\"24 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">22 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Thu</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 97%;\" data-a=\"97%\" data-ta=\"31 reports\" data-b=\"53%\" data-tb=\"17 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">31 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Fri</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 28%;\" data-a=\"28%\" data-ta=\"9 reports\" data-b=\"19%\" data-tb=\"6 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sat</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 13%;\" data-a=\"13%\" data-ta=\"4 reports\" data-b=\"25%\" data-tb=\"8 reports\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">4 reports</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sun</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Distribution",
        "desc": "Puskesmas per accreditation level. One series, one color, no highlight when no single bar is the answer.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">How are puskesmas accredited?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Accreditation level, 42 puskesmas in three regencies</div></div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Accreditation: Paripurna 12, Utama 18, Madya 9, Dasar 3 puskesmas\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 60%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Paripurna</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 90%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Utama</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 45%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Madya</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 15%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">3 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Dasar</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Grouped and stacked, from data",
        "desc": "The same weeks two ways. Grouped compares statuses within a week; stacked shows the total and its parts. Both are drawn from data by `data-lds-chart`; switch a status off in the legend and the others close the gap.",
        "html": "<div class=\"auto-grid\" style=\"--min: 300px;\">\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-g\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-g\">Are more reports handled on time?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Citizen reports per week by status</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Citizen reports per week by status, last 6 weeks. On time grew from 58 to 74; late stayed under 12.\",\"x\":[\"W41\",\"W42\",\"W43\",\"W44\",\"W45\",\"W46\"],\"xFull\":[\"Week of 5 Oct\",\"Week of 12 Oct\",\"Week of 19 Oct\",\"Week of 26 Oct\",\"Week of 2 Nov\",\"Week of 9 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Week\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"On time\",\"values\":[58,61,66,63,70,74]},{\"name\":\"Late\",\"values\":[11,9,12,8,7,6]},{\"name\":\"Not handled\",\"values\":[6,5,4,6,3,2],\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200}'></div></section>\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-s\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-s\">How many reports each week?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Citizen reports per week, stacked by status</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Citizen reports per week, stacked by status. Totals between 75 and 82; the unhandled share keeps shrinking.\",\"x\":[\"W41\",\"W42\",\"W43\",\"W44\",\"W45\",\"W46\"],\"xFull\":[\"Week of 5 Oct\",\"Week of 12 Oct\",\"Week of 19 Oct\",\"Week of 26 Oct\",\"Week of 2 Nov\",\"Week of 9 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Week\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"On time\",\"values\":[58,61,66,63,70,74]},{\"name\":\"Late\",\"values\":[11,9,12,8,7,6]},{\"name\":\"Not handled\",\"values\":[6,5,4,6,3,2],\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200,\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true}'></div></section>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "In and out around zero",
        "desc": "Negative values stack below the zero line, so money in and money out share one scale. The tooltip adds them into the month's total.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-c\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-c\">Did each month end positive?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Market levies and upkeep costs per month, 2026</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Money in and out per month, 2026. Every month but August ended positive.\",\"x\":[\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Aug\",\"Sep\",\"Oct\",\"Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"June\",\"July\",\"August\",\"September\",\"October\",\"November\"],\"xName\":\"Month\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true,\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"Rp \",\"suffix\":\" M\",\"compact\":true},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Market levies\",\"values\":[184,212,158,241,269,283],\"color\":3},{\"name\":\"Upkeep costs\",\"values\":[-142,-151,-173,-168,-179,-186],\"color\":2}],\"height\":220}'></div></section>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Sorot jawabannya",
        "desc": "Hari tersibuk memakai warna seri, sisanya diredam. Arahkan kursor ke batang mana pun untuk melihat nilainya; batang lain meredup. Dengan `data-lds-grow` batang naik dari garis dasar saat pertama terlihat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Hari apa yang paling sibuk?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Laporan warga yang masuk per hari, minggu ini</div></div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Laporan warga per hari. Jumat paling sibuk dengan 31 laporan.\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 38%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sen</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 56%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sel</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 81%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">26 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Rab</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 69%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">22 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Kam</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 97%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">31 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Jum</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 28%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sab</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar bars__bar--muted\" style=\"height: 13%;\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">4 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Min</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Mengganti periode",
        "desc": "Ganti minggunya: tinggi batang berubah selama 480 ms dengan kurva in-out, dari posisinya saat itu.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;\">\n    <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Hari apa yang paling sibuk?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Laporan warga yang masuk per hari</div></div>\n    <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Periode\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 200px;\">\n      <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('.bars__bar').forEach(b => { b.style.height = b.dataset.a; b.firstChild.textContent = b.dataset.ta; })\">Minggu ini</button>\n      <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('.bars__bar').forEach(b => { b.style.height = b.dataset.b; b.firstChild.textContent = b.dataset.tb; })\">Minggu lalu</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Laporan warga per hari untuk minggu yang dipilih\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 38%;\" data-a=\"38%\" data-ta=\"12 laporan\" data-b=\"47%\" data-tb=\"15 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sen</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 56%;\" data-a=\"56%\" data-ta=\"18 laporan\" data-b=\"66%\" data-tb=\"21 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sel</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 81%;\" data-a=\"81%\" data-ta=\"26 laporan\" data-b=\"59%\" data-tb=\"19 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">26 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Rab</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 69%;\" data-a=\"69%\" data-ta=\"22 laporan\" data-b=\"75%\" data-tb=\"24 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">22 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Kam</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 97%;\" data-a=\"97%\" data-ta=\"31 laporan\" data-b=\"53%\" data-tb=\"17 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">31 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Jum</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 28%;\" data-a=\"28%\" data-ta=\"9 laporan\" data-b=\"19%\" data-tb=\"6 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Sab</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 13%;\" data-a=\"13%\" data-ta=\"4 laporan\" data-b=\"25%\" data-tb=\"8 laporan\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">4 laporan</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Min</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sebaran",
        "desc": "Jumlah puskesmas per tingkat akreditasi. Satu seri, satu warna, tanpa sorotan karena tidak ada satu batang yang menjadi jawaban.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\">Bagaimana sebaran akreditasi puskesmas?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Tingkat akreditasi, 42 puskesmas di tiga kabupaten</div></div>\n  <div class=\"bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Akreditasi: Paripurna 12, Utama 18, Madya 9, Dasar 3 puskesmas\">\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 60%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">12 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Paripurna</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 90%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">18 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Utama</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 45%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">9 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Madya</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bars__col\"><span class=\"bars__bar\" style=\"height: 15%; background: var(--series-3);\"><span class=\"bars__tip\">3 puskesmas</span></span><span class=\"bars__x\">Dasar</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Berkelompok dan bertumpuk, dari data",
        "desc": "Minggu yang sama dengan dua cara. Berkelompok membandingkan status dalam satu minggu; bertumpuk menunjukkan total dan bagiannya. Keduanya digambar dari data oleh `data-lds-chart`; matikan satu status di legenda dan yang lain merapat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"auto-grid\" style=\"--min: 300px;\">\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-g\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-g\">Apakah makin banyak laporan ditangani tepat waktu?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Laporan warga per minggu menurut status</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Laporan warga per minggu menurut status, 6 minggu terakhir. Tepat waktu naik dari 58 ke 74; terlambat tetap di bawah 12.\",\"x\":[\"M41\",\"M42\",\"M43\",\"M44\",\"M45\",\"M46\"],\"xFull\":[\"Minggu 5 Okt\",\"Minggu 12 Okt\",\"Minggu 19 Okt\",\"Minggu 26 Okt\",\"Minggu 2 Nov\",\"Minggu 9 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Minggu\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Tepat waktu\",\"values\":[58,61,66,63,70,74]},{\"name\":\"Terlambat\",\"values\":[11,9,12,8,7,6]},{\"name\":\"Belum ditangani\",\"values\":[6,5,4,6,3,2],\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200}'></div></section>\n  <section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-s\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-s\">Berapa total laporan tiap minggu?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Laporan warga per minggu, bertumpuk menurut status</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Laporan warga per minggu, bertumpuk menurut status. Totalnya antara 75 dan 82; porsi yang belum ditangani terus mengecil.\",\"x\":[\"M41\",\"M42\",\"M43\",\"M44\",\"M45\",\"M46\"],\"xFull\":[\"Minggu 5 Okt\",\"Minggu 12 Okt\",\"Minggu 19 Okt\",\"Minggu 26 Okt\",\"Minggu 2 Nov\",\"Minggu 9 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Minggu\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Tepat waktu\",\"values\":[58,61,66,63,70,74]},{\"name\":\"Terlambat\",\"values\":[11,9,12,8,7,6]},{\"name\":\"Belum ditangani\",\"values\":[6,5,4,6,3,2],\"color\":\"neutral\"}],\"height\":200,\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true}'></div></section>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Masuk dan keluar di sekitar nol",
        "desc": "Nilai negatif bertumpuk di bawah garis nol, jadi uang masuk dan keluar memakai satu skala. Tooltip menjumlahkannya menjadi total bulan itu.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\" aria-labelledby=\"bc-c\"><div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"bc-c\">Apakah setiap bulan berakhir surplus?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Retribusi pasar dan biaya perawatan per bulan, 2026</div></div><div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Uang masuk dan keluar per bulan, 2026. Semua bulan kecuali Agustus berakhir surplus.\",\"x\":[\"Jun\",\"Jul\",\"Agu\",\"Sep\",\"Okt\",\"Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"Juni\",\"Juli\",\"Agustus\",\"September\",\"Oktober\",\"November\"],\"xName\":\"Bulan\",\"kind\":\"bar\",\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true,\"format\":{\"prefix\":\"Rp \",\"suffix\":\" jt\",\"compact\":true},\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Retribusi pasar\",\"values\":[184,212,158,241,269,283],\"color\":3},{\"name\":\"Biaya perawatan\",\"values\":[-142,-151,-173,-168,-179,-186],\"color\":2}],\"height\":220}'></div></section>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
